cases
requirement	case	module	access program	error	reason	output	diagnostic	assertion
sqlite.1	1	sqlite	load					each table is one sheet named as the table, its column names the header, views and indexes left behind by type and name
sqlite.2	1	sqlite	load	cannot be represented				a value whose typeof is blob ends the load as cannot be represented
sqlite.3	1	sqlite	load	failed				a file that does not begin with the database header's magic string ends the load as failed
